00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:10.000
completely not be accountable

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.820
and need us for everything.

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.630
- Yeah, that's a really good point

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:16.430
you know, because, you
know we kind of know

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.870
that we're in this epidemic right now

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.130
of loneliness and drugs
and no human connection

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.380
all that stuff, but I never thought of

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.640
I never really focused
on the parental side.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.730
- It's the answer, in my opinion.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:29.563
- I think you're right, I--

00:06:29.563 --> 00:06:32.250
- I think we have a
contemporary parenting problem

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.080
that tells children by our behavior

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.800
