00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.457
I just do it.

00:06:55.457 --> 00:06:56.290
Do you do that?

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.380
Are you better than that?
- I don't do that

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:59.700
