entitlement in different ways

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.220
which is, I'm actually
taking on the core pressures

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.970
which eventually, I had a
interesting period in this company

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:08.140
several years ago, where I
had to reset a little bit

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.190
