00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:12.893
From not micromanaging,
'cause I don't micromanage.

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:15.810
I don't create a whole
lot of accountability.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.570
We just lost a fortune,
