had somebody, I did and--

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:11.950
- 'cause I've written, five New York Times

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:14.340
bestselling books and Stephanie
Land is my ghostwriter

00:22:14.340 --> 00:22:17.480
but the way I do it is, I just
sit with her for 30,40 days.

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:20.550
She records everything and
makes it into proper grammar.

00:22:20.550 --> 00:22:22.830
Not a word in there is hers.

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.580
- Yeah, okay, so this is
what happened with us--

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:26.490
