00:22:31.210 --> 00:22:33.237
You think, "Oh, Katie wrote it

00:22:33.237 --> 00:22:34.590
"and I'm slapping my name on it."

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:37.390
Like, I literally read and I hate reading

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:39.420
my own books multiple times, in case

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:41.230
God forbid, there's some word

00:22:41.230 --> 00:22:43.080
