00:22:45.352 --> 00:22:48.270
(laughing)

00:22:48.270 --> 00:22:52.040
- So we had a publishing date
and then I said to my wife

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:53.500
you know, the publisher likes it

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:56.140
people are liking it and Veronica read it

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:56.997
and she said--
- It's garbage.

00:22:56.997 --> 00:22:58.300
