00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:31.330
- And I wanna give some, in
case somebody's listening

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:32.430
you know, here.

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.210
- They can Google, you've got
that plenty of double use.

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:35.700
- Well, mostly it's
about Jim, you know like.

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:39.060
For example, it just was shitty.

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:40.230
I mean it was--
- Why?

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:44.200
It was kind of a shitty idea,
it was an old-fashioned idea.

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:47.880
I guess, you know, the
superstars got excited about it--

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:49.250
- Let's go different way.

00:23:49.250 --> 00:23:50.490
And this is a fun question.
- It just wasn't good

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:51.323
I was embarrassed.

00:23:51.323 --> 00:23:55.260
I use it as, when I say
